M10 objective controller: add a primary objective before completing it.

Only the Power Plant (1001) and Comm Center (1004) senders add their objective
before completing it. Con Yard 1002, gates 1005/1006/1007 and the Level-1 key
1012 are added only by their briefing (zones 4/1/18/7 and the KEY_OBJ timer).
When the player completes one of them first, Set_Objective_Status finds no
objective and does nothing, primary_count still counts it, and the late
briefing then adds the objective as pending. It can never complete again, and
its HUD priority (74-80) sorts its pog ahead of the beacon objective 1003 (73),
so the HUD points at an open gate or a destroyed Con Yard. The controller now
calls Add_An_Objective for a primary before marking it accomplished. When the
objective already exists, ObjectiveManager::Add_Objective returns at once and
only the HUD position and blip are set again before the status change. The
late briefing's add is then a duplicate and is ignored. Counting and
completion are unchanged.

--- a/Mission10.cpp
+++ b/Mission10.cpp
@@ -526,6 +526,14 @@
 					}
 					else
 					{
+						// Vita: add a primary before completing it. A gate poked, the Con Yard
+						// destroyed or the key picked up before its briefing completed nothing,
+						// and the late briefing then added a stale pending primary whose HUD pog
+						// outranks the beacon objective 1003. Add_Objective ignores duplicates.
+						if (type < 1008 || type == 1012)
+						{
+							Add_An_Objective(type);
+						}
 						Commands->Set_Objective_Status(type, OBJECTIVE_STATUS_ACCOMPLISHED);
 						if (type < 1008 || type == 1012)
 						{
